@YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### A match: the sample districts for a typed address
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?address=1420%20Maple%20Street,%20Springfield
Accept: application/json

### The same, from a point
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?lat=39.8&lon=-89.65
Accept: application/json

### No match: 404, because the stub wants a house number
GET {{YourElectionMap.Server_HostAddress}}/api/districts?address=Main%20Street
Accept: application/json

###
